  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.0:\n\t\t\t- Added EventFluxOptions configuration for ambient scope (CreateScopePerEvent = false)\n\t\t\t- Added PublishStrategy option (Parallel and Sequential execution)\n\t\t\t- Added CancellationToken overload on IEventHandler via default interface methods\n\t\t\t- Registered EventStackService as DI singleton for cross-scope deferred batch dispatch\n\t\t\t- Added HandlerLifetime option (Transient, Scoped, Singleton) and cleaned up concrete DI registrations\n\t\t\t- Hardened EventService and EventMapService with type-safe lookups and C# record support\n\t\t\t- Added duplicate request handler detection guard during AddEventBus registration\n\t\t\t- Aligned CanHandle behavior across SendAsync and updated nullable return contract to Task<TResponse?>",
